91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:36.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:46.56,Title,,0,0,240,,Bellamy The PirateDialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san.Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:54.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,There is nothing he can gain from you, a veritable child of destruction!Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:56.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:59.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's free!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I won't truly become free...Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:10.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,until I fulfill your dream!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:11.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Room!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:15.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Not until I stop Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:19.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think of Monkey D. Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:22.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that you were...Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,a Celestial Dragon until today!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:26.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Chambres!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you make of "D"?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.74,Main,,0,0,0,,none of your concern!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:52.68,Main,,0,0,0,,So what? Are you saying Straw Hat Luffy was led here by destiny...Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:57.78,Main,,0,0,0,,to kill me, since I have the blood of the gods in my veins?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,How idiotic!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:07.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And in a certain land, there are people who call the Family of "D"...Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,"the sworn enemy of the gods"!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a "D" too!Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:26.41,Main,,0,0,0,,How are the battles going, Viola?Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.78,Main,,0,0,0,,In the decisive battle on the top floor of the Palace,Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:33.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat has been thrown down to the lower level,Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:36.16,Main,,0,0,0,,and Law cannot measure up against Doflamingo.Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The fighting in this country can be divided into three major fronts.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:44.30,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The Royal Palace Grounds.Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:44.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:44.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:44.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:44.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:44.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:44.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:44.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.59,0:03:44.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:44.67,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:44.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:44.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:44.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:45.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The statue of Pica.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:47.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:47.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:47.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:47.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:47.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:47.30,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:47.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.34,0:03:47.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:47.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:47.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:47.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:47.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:47.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:47.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:47.67,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:50.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,Smile FactoryDialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.68,Main,,0,0,0,,The Smile Factory.Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:52.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:53.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Restrain anyone running wild!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:59.76,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as the fighting continues...Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:02.59,Main,,0,0,0,,The number of victims will keep rising.Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.92,Main,,0,0,0,,V-Viola.Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:12.40,Main,,0,0,0,,How many commanders of the Donquixote Family are left?Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,There are still quite a few left.Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.98,Main,,0,0,0,,One of the major battlefronts,Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,the Smile Factory, is protected by one of the commanders,Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:24.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Smile FactoryDialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:24.84,Main,,0,0,0,,the free-swimming man, Senor Pink!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,In the second battlefront, the statue of Pica, there is the top commander,Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,The statue of PicaDialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:41.54,Main,,0,0,1,,the stone assimilation man, Pica!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,And the third front, the Royal Palace Grounds.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,On its top floor, there are...Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:53.66,Main,,0,0,0,,the current king of Dressrosa,Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:55.97,Main,,0,0,0,,the string man, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,And chief of staff, the mucus man, Trebol!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,In the Sunflower Field on the fourth level,Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:05.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:06.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Fourth LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,there's the hero of the Colosseum, the flag man,Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamante!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,And on the third level, there's the rupture man in charge of all the underlings,Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:16.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,Fourth LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:16.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:16.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:16.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:16.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:16.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:16.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:16.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:16.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:16.50,Cap