ird LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:17.88,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:17.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:17.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.84,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Gladius!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:29.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:28.32,Main,,0,0,0,,There are four commanders on the second level.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:33.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The Fighting Fish half-fishman, Dellinger!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The Geo-Fist user,Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Lao G!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:43.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The super-weight man,Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Machvise!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The full-body weapon woman,Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:54.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby 5!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:01.28,Main,,0,0,0,,There are still ten who are ranked commander and higher.Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you...Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:33.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The breeze is clouding my eyes.Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:37.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! So hard-boiled!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,In most of the battles,Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,everyone's heavily injured!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:58.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The climax of the fighting is not too far away!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:05.09,Captions,,0,0,240,,Palace Plateau 4th stepDialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You insolent little...Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Army Bandera!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:39.49,Main,,0,0,0,,The ground is...Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:47.40,Main,,0,0,0,,How do you like it?! The ground ripples like a flag!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're struggling just to stay upright!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Clutch!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:09.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Rebecca.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:14.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel. Leave this place in my hands.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.72,0:08:15.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, go on!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:19.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Pierna Fleur!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly! Your attacks are putting me to sleep!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Gladius!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.35,0:08:49.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:49.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:49.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:49.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:49.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:49.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:49.77,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:49.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:49.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:49.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.89,0:08:49.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:49.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:50.02,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:50.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:50.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:50.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:50.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:50.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:50.27,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:50.31,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:50.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:50.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:50.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:50.48