ptions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:51.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:51.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:51.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:51.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:51.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:51.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:51.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:51.77,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.77,0:08:51.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:51.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:51.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:51.94,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:51.98,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:52.02,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:52.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:52.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:52.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:52.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:52.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:52.27,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:52.31,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:52.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:52.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:52.44,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:52.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:52.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:52.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:52.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:52.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:52.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:52.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:52.77,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.77,0:08:52.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:52.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:53.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:55.31,Captions,,0,0,0,,Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Destructive Cannon!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Missed me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:25.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Ten-Ton...Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.99,0:09:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Vise!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I was right!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:42.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You just...Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,did it again!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:55.22,Captions,,0,0,175,,Inside the Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Mansherry!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:12.91,Captions,,0,0,190,,In Front of the Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:17.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you very much!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry, get to somewhere safe!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:22.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Although nowhere is safe.Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If they can't take down Doflamingo,Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,we will all meet our end within this bird cage.Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you saying we must leave the fate of this country to those pirates?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a "D"?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Your secret name?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say you were destined to be here?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:06.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You think you can stop me because you're a "D"?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:09.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The Family of "D" is the sworn enemy of the gods?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That's just a superstition!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:19.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa, Doffy, watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You're within range of Law's power!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Injection...Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Shot!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:39.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san was fully aware of that.Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:44.38,Main,,0,0,0,,If I could defeat you with just my name, it would've been so easy.Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That was the catalyst.Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here...Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:12:00.18,Main,,0,0,0,,...because the kindhearted Cora-san couldn't pull the trigger that day!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here to pull it on his behalf!Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:31.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't like it...Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Room!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:38.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm really disappointed in you.Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:44.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Tact!Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:49.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy! The rampart tower...Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's flying toward us!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Spiderweb!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:20.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Chambres!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:22.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Mes!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:22.93,Note,,0,0,0,,ScalpelDialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:31.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Just quit with the pointless attacks already!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:37.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You really have become one passionate, confident bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't see the big picture.Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You're always worrying about meaningless things.Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:50.09,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why you can't seize the moment.Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The weaker a person is, the more they care about other people's pain,Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:56.61,Main,,0,0,0,,which leads to their demise.Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:14:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,If you really wanted to kill me,Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,you should've stuck to the plan of making me clash with Kaidou.Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:11.95,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of ways to defeat an enemy stronger than you.Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.95,0:14:15.61,Main,,0,0,0,,But you thought of Corazón, got emotional,Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:19.93,Main,,0,0,0,,and the moment you decided to strike me yourself,Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,your death was guaranteed!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the letter from back then?Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:39.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This small package will save...Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:42.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,a far-off kingdom called Dressrosa.Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A kingdom?Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:46.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Someone asked you to give me this, right?Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:47.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:51.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it. Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.91,0:14:59.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón was trying to save Dressrosa.Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:05.81,Main,,0,0,0,,If only you hadn't blown it that day...Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,After all, you're partly responsible for Corazón's death!Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:17.29,Main,,0,0,0,,With that letter,Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:22.77,Main,,0,0,0,,the countless tragedies that fell upon this country...Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:25.93,Main,,0,0,0,,might never have happened.Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that what you really think?Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:38.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You've kept your cool. That's smart.Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The way I see it, even if that letter had been delivered,Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:49.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I would've just changed plans and taken this country's throne some other way!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything that Corazón risked his life for was in vain.Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:07.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's for me to decide!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever I accomplish in my life is because of Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:19.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? What a tear-jerking sentiment!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:23.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:29.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever the tragedy or mistake, only the things that actually happened are written in stone!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:33.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Like how you ate the Operation Fruit and ran away,Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,or the fact that you are here now after baring your fangs at Punk Hazard!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.77,Main,,0,0,0,,He did it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.35,Main,,0,0,0,,String Saw! String Saw!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:01.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you were influenced by the other "D" or not,Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:04.37,Main,,0,0,0,,but you coming here to challenge me yourself,Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,is now also written in stone!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I forgive you!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:16.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I forgave my father and brother...Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,you will be forgiven through your death!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:23.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:26.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Jet...Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:34.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Lead bullets really are the best way to execute someone.Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy's double!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:54.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:03.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy's double has broken apart!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess the cage was a bit too small...Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:22.85,Main,,0,0,0,,to keep it locked up.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy...Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop Bellamy! He's gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You're still alive...Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's fine.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:06.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Bellamy. I set you free.Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Like you have always been.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:24.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.55,0:19:26.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're all from Nortis.Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:29.93,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's a wealthy town. What's your problem with it?Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:32.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That town is such a bore!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:35.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The Donquixote Family is the pride of North Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:41.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We wanna become a pirate crew like yours!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:46.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're nothing like the dreamer pirates you see around these days.Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.17,0:19:49.75,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll let you fly our flag if that's what you want.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:51.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:55.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,However, if you're ever defeated, that right will be revoked.Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:19:58.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Really?! Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:06.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I have no need for weak underlings.Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:08.77,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We won't lose! Not to anyone!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:16.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Not so much, huh...Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:21.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The era where pirates dream is over!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:25.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping my Spring Fruit ability!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:32.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Spring...Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.15,0:20:34.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hopper!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:58.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I went to Sky Island, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:04.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I lost my crew, but it turned my world around completely.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:07.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I bear you no grudge.Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:10.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I won't laugh at you anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:13.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bellamy.Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.99,0:21:15.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You've changed, Bellamy.Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:18.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't push yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.87,0:21:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You better stay down.Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:26.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Joker wants me to kill Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:29.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Doffy is far too soft.Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:34.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't think you deserve another chance after failing in the tournament.Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:36.07,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A lucky break for you, Bellamy.Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:44.93,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Well, I figured you'd lose your nerve and be unable to kill him.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:48.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? A big quake again!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:56.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it straight, Bellamy.Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.47,0:21:59.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You and I always had different goals.Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:06.07,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:08.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.09,0:22:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.83,0:22:16.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but wait here. I'm worried about Traf!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:19.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo and Snot are up there.Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.95,0:22:22.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta go help or Traf'll be in trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll kick Mingo's ass for you, too!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:33.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember this technique?Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:37.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.05,0:22:39.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Spring...Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:41.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Hopper!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:47.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You got stronger, but so did I!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This technique is far more destructive than it used to be!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.75,0:22:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! You'll die if you keep moving around like that!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:01.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop worrying about your enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.37,0:23:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I get it now!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.27,0:23:12.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That I admired the wrong man! And how pathetic I am!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.93,0:23:19.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.63,0:23:23.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,up to the winner to decide!Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:28.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This fool came to me to get killed.Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.65,0:23:30.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Right, Bellamy?Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:37.37,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to do something so pathetic as to turn my back on the man I admired...Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,just because I didn't get the answer I wanted!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.67,0:23:47.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I know I'm an idiot...Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.31,0:23:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But even an idiot has principles he must stick to!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.83,0:23:54.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, this'll be my last fight!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.57,0:23:56.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Now fight me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:24:02.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Datenshi, Sewil  QC: Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000, Datenshi Grug  Soundtracking: Halee  TC/Infoboxes:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis